    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-allocation, stream-oriented AT command parser for cellular &amp; serial modems. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Lightweight, non-blocking line and prompt parser for modems (SIM800, Quectel, ESP-AT, etc.). Feeds from <ref refid="structSYN__Stream" kindref="compound">SYN_Stream</ref> or raw byte feeds, handles CRLF line framing, prompt &apos;&gt;&apos; detection, CME ERROR decoding, URC filtering, and parameter extraction without dynamic memory allocation.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Usage</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">static</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">char</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>line_buf[128];</highlight></codeline>
